Z||000010||artherd||08-14-2001||07:14 AM||||Hiya MM, I wanted to wish you good luck in whatever roads you choose, we're all behind ya man!<P>Here's a question, what would you do if you had a million dollars?  I mean with your time.   The answer to that question is what you're looking for methinks :)<P>You don't nessicarily need to be "qualified" for anything, just want to do it. (exceptions include doctor, etc.)  The average human being is far far more intelligent and well trained than they give themselves credit to being!<P>PS: with my sprint PCS cell phone, and laptop, I have internet (14.4k) via their 'nationwide long distance' anywhere I go (so long as there's a sprint tower nearby :P)  good stuff, and no wires!<P>------------------<BR>  <IMG SRC="http://www.cartsys.com/fiero/88ttop.jpg">  <BR>Ben Cannon<BR>88 Formula, T-top Metalic Red<BR>88 Formula, Silver<BR>87 Coupe, Metalic Red<BR>"Every Man Dies, not every man really Lives"<BR>                -Mel Gibson, "Braveheart"||||reg||3
